# Keep one line ending in the repository and in every checkout.
#
# The release provenance hash, the distribution verifier and several tests hash
# file *bytes*: a manuscript checked out with CRLF on Windows therefore carried a
# different source digest than the same commit on Linux, and
# `test_legacy_v11_graph_fingerprint_matches_public_v051_output` failed on a file
# nobody had edited. Text is stored and checked out as LF so one commit means one
# set of bytes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Fixtures that must keep exactly the bytes they were recorded with.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.whl binary
*.gz binary
